    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "champ_0270_rival_02",
      "hash64": "0D4215CEA0DB2012",
      "text": "Sag nichts, ich seh’s dir doch an der Nasenspitze\\nan! Du bist jetzt auch Champ, stimmt’s?[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "champ_0270_rival_no_01",
      "hash64": "5254D5B6CD6685EF",
      "text": "Ach komm, du vergackeierst mich doch nur!\\nGib’s zu, du bist jetzt auch Champ, oder?[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "champ_0270_rival_no_02",
      "hash64": "5254D6B6CD6687A2",
      "text": "Sorry, aber das kauf ich dir nicht ab! Los, spann\\nmich nicht auf die Folter! Bist du nun Champ?![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "champ_0270_rival_no_03",
      "hash64": "5254D7B6CD668955",
      "text": "Hast du in all der Aufregung etwa die Bedeutung\\nvon „ja“ und „nein“ vergessen?! Du siehst mir\\r\\nwirklich stark nach einem Champ aus...![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 136,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "champ_0270_rival_no_04",
      "hash64": "5254D0B6CD667D70",
      "text": "Noch mal zum Mitschreiben...\\nDU. BIST. JETZT. CHAMP. JA?![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "champ_0270_rival_03",
      "hash64": "0D4216CEA0DB21C5",
      "text": "Hehehe, das wusste ich schon![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "champ_0270_rival_04",
      "hash64": "0D420FCEA0DB15E0",
      "text": "Direkt im Anschluss an deine praktische Prüfung\\nhat mir nämlich der Top-Champ Bescheid gesagt.[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "champ_0270_rival_05",
      "hash64": "0D4210CEA0DB1793",
      "text": "Ich bin Champ und du bist jetzt auch Champ...\\nDu weißt, was das bedeutet, oder?[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "champ_0270_rival_06",
      "hash64": "0D4211CEA0DB1946",
      "text": "Wir haben beide den Champ-Rang und sind\\nsomit gleichauf![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 56,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "champ_0270_rival_07",
      "hash64": "0D4212CEA0DB1AF9",
      "text": "Deshalb will ich dich ganz offiziell fragen...[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "champ_0270_rival_08",
      "hash64": "0D421BCEA0DB2A44",
      "text": "Bitte werde [VAR 0x1100(00FF,0D0B,0000)]mein Rivalemeine Rivalin, ja?[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 4,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0D0B",
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "champ_0270_rival_no_05",
      "hash64": "5254D1B6CD667F23",
      "text": "Hm? Was war das...? Ich hab dich nicht gehört.\\nAlso noch mal: Bitte werde [VAR 0x1100(00FF,0D0B,0000)]mein Rivalemeine Rivalin, ja?[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 4,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0D0B",
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 109,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "champ_0270_rival_no_06",
      "hash64": "5254D2B6CD6680D6",
      "text": "Wenn du glaubst, dass ich so leicht aufgebe,\\nhast du dich aber geschnitten.\\c\\nIch frage so lange weiter, bis ich ein klares „Ja“\\nvon dir höre!\\c\\nIch will, dass du [VAR 0x1100(00FF,0D0B,0000)]mein Rivalemeine Rivalin wirst! Na?[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 143,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 165,
          "count": 4,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0D0B",
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 206,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "champ_0270_rival_no_07",
      "hash64": "5254D3B6CD668289",
      "text": "Okay, also... Nur, dass ich das richtig verstehe...\\nDu willst [VAR 0x1100(00FF,0D0B,0000)]mein Rivalemeine Rivalin sein, stimmt’s?[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 4,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0D0B",
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 108,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "champ_0270_rival_no_08",
      "hash64": "5254DCB6CD6691D4",
      "text": "Hm, vielleicht hörst DU mich ja nicht richtig...\\nWILLST DU [VAR 0x1100(00FF,0D0B,0000)]MEIN RIVALEMEINE RIVALIN WERDEN?![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
